    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Welcome to 5 The Mews, Station Manor, a fabulous 4 bedroom semi-detached family home ideally nestled in a quiet cul de sac which has been beautifully decorated by its current owners with premium fixtures, fittings and superb finishes throughout. \r\n\r\nUpon entering this energy efficient home buyers will be instantly impressed by the modern flooring, high ceilings, spacious rooms and brightness throughout. The accommodation comprises of an entrance hall, guest WC, lounge, open plan kitchen / dining room and family room area with a utility room off the kitchen. On the first floor there are 3 spacious bedrooms with a guest bedroom ensuite and a large family bathroom. On the 2nd floor there is a large master bedroom, an abundance of storage and master ensuite. All guest bedrooms feature built in wardrobes that provide excellent storage. The rear garden boasts a large porcelain tiled patio area, manicured lawn and the added benefit of a large side passage with side gate entrance. \r\n\r\nLocated just a short walk from Portmarnock Village and Beach, it has every conceivable amenity right on your doorstep. These include schools, shops, bars & restaurants, golf courses, and excellent public transport with train to and from Dublin City Centre only a minute walk away and lots of different bus routes also only a short distance away."
      },
